"umbra-survivors", "summary": "Umbra Survivors is a roguelite action survival game set in a dark fantasy world. Players fight through multiple progressively challenging stages while facing ever-growing waves of enemies.\n\nThe game combines fast-paced combat with random upgrades, card-based level-ups and dynamic scaling. Players collect weapons, passive enhancements and rare artifacts as they advance through different environments.\n\nEach run offers new enemy compositions and risk\u2013reward scenarios. Progression is driven by random weapon and stat rolls, supported by a variety of starting weapons and passive abilities.\n\nUmbra Survivors draws inspiration from classic bullet-hell and roguelite mechanics, focusing on clarity, stage variety and long-term survival gameplay.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/umbra-survivors"}